        "spya-s2680p",
        "spya-qsfkqr"
      ],
      "title": "The costs of relational living",
      "gist": "Relational living is humanity's default and can be satisfying, but it makes personal dignity depend on group membership, turning gossip into a tool for defending collective reputation."
    },
